@HexMaster.Guestbook.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5046

### Sign the guestbook with coordinates the client shared (visitor granted location access).
POST {{HexMaster.Guestbook.Api_HostAddress}}/greet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hi from Amsterdam!",
  "lat": 52.3676,
  "lng": 4.9041
}

### Sign the guestbook without coordinates — the server approximates the location from the
### client IP address, and stores it as unknown (lat/lng null) when that resolves to nothing.
### Expect null coordinates in the response when calling from loopback or a private IP.
POST {{HexMaster.Guestbook.Api_HostAddress}}/greet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hi from somewhere!"
}

### Coordinates must be sent together — this returns 400 ValidationProblem.
POST {{HexMaster.Guestbook.Api_HostAddress}}/greet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Half a location",
  "lat": 52.3676
}

### List the newest greetings. Entries with an unknown location come back with lat/lng null.
GET {{HexMaster.Guestbook.Api_HostAddress}}/greetings?pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###
